{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259140/extras/a04ef9e19756b491f788bb81bbc36f79.poster.avif?t=1766933105\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259140/extras/a04ef9e19756b491f788bb81bbc36f79.webm?t=1766933105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259140/extras/a04ef9e19756b491f788bb81bbc36f79.mp4?t=1766933105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br><br>Ashina: The Red Witch is an exploration-based, story-adventure game. Use items to solve puzzles as well as talk to many other characters to help dig into the story even further!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259140/extras/a8f287f2ccd92c9cbfeaa30ab4f60552.apng?t=1766933105\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259140/extras/a8f287f2ccd92c9cbfeaa30ab4f60552.poster.avif?t=1766933105\" class=\"bb_img\" width=768 height=96 /></picture></span><br>Join Ash on the journey of an afterlife-time! Travel through a mysterious spirit world filled with strange creatures, interesting characters, and memorable moments! Ash must find her way back home and save her sister from the powers that be.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259140/extras/9154860af33729ca2d1c4125f25700e7.apng?t=1766933105\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259140/extras/9154860af33729ca2d1c4125f25700e7.poster.avif?t=1766933105\" class=\"bb_img\" width=768 height=96 /></picture></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A unique and (hopefully) thrilling story!<br></li><li>New and exciting characters, as well as some returning characters from  'My Big Sister'.<br></li><li>Adventure-like puzzles.<br></li><li>Character dialogue options to delve into the lore surrounding the universe.<br></li><li>An Original Soundtrack.<br></li><li>Achievements + Trophies! </li></ul><br>My stories are made for the fans and players, and I would love to continue sharing them with everyone! <br><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259140/extras/49317b349e4230e400bfec7e86155da9.apng?t=1766933105\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259140/extras/49317b349e4230e400bfec7e86155da9.poster.avif?t=1766933105\" class=\"bb_img\" width=768 height=192 /></picture></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Wash your hands.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1259140/c1adb70ad59b885416a898e5fcd655164b8bfcd8.jpg"},{"name":"A sisterly chat.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1259140/72c46036299a80b81e546cf051db5b2090154c8a.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to Shiruta!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1259140/35a698d62578c0974e145a99656a211f51fcce23.jpg"},{"name":"Repair it!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1259140/75a6ccaf30b51d28d6b80391bf1dd3750a66b33e.jpg"},{"name":"A kind heart.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1259140/f404aec2b3111d95cc559199aace08be144f9a06.jpg"},{"name":"Talk of the town!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1259140/43a577689461921266fddb1cb371012c65efdd9e.jpg"},{"name":"The bathhouse.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1259140/67a108b788a0179f949370dfe5fc856f2c08f672.jpg"},{"name":"The secret switch!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com